        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"78decd4f-8175-4bd6-8dfa-06f7e187f164\",\"review_text\":\"I hate the application 👎🖕\"},{\"review_id\":\"d51d93d1-b7c1-458a-9741-b28b0bad90eb\",\"review_text\":\"Any music what your heart desire.\"},{\"review_id\":\"0d2e323c-df0c-4c8c-8e12-25d1d611fd42\",\"review_text\":\"This is great app\"},{\"review_id\":\"bcf6b061-b85d-411f-856c-d17ea0e70458\",\"review_text\":\"Vraiment un scandale de payer aussi cher pour une app aussi mal fichue et pleine de bug 🥲 et que ce soit sur android, IOS or desktop c'est pareil.\"},{\"review_id\":\"7ee7cd2e-f067-46e5-b9b4-0070813bb29c\",\"review_text\":\"It's the best app to listen to any song!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"fc1bab4f-d45c-4472-80c3-610957595813\",\"review_text\":\"First I loved this app but as per time they are so desperate to get premium subscribers that they have floped there app from my pov. They enable the play in order thing and also to back the song which is very dissapointing if this is gonna be there then I am gonna change my music app for sure and from my pov they are losing there downloads just because they want premium subscribers which is very very dissapointing\"},{\"review_id\":\"d6dfa1f4-8b15-44e9-92c7-68283f42ed2f\",\"review_text\":\"Only got this app because of the discord icon but very good app if you have subscription if you don't have Spotify premium it really sucks\"},{\"review_id\":\"b1cc06bf-f938-4f87-8777-e7bab278f25f\",\"review_text\":\"It's so good\"},{\"review_id\":\"4352e93d-befb-4181-a6b5-bc8918a5403b\",\"review_text\":\"Best app i ever seen ❤\"},{\"review_id\":\"0b39563c-53b3-4947-8f02-1331865b3d81\",\"review_text\":\"This is not fair we cannot listen to music how we want\"}]}"
